      "message": "Looking at the bq25710.c driver, I think you can change this to just:\n\n    #undef CONFIG_CHARGER_BQ25720\n    #ifdef CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_CHARGER_BQ25720\n    #define CONFIG_CHARGER_BQ25720\n    #endif\n\nFor cros EC builds, when using the bq25720 charger, CONFIG_CHARGER_BQ25710 is defined only so the build.mk picks up the bq25710.c driver.  CMakeLists.txt doesn\u0027t have this dependency.\n\nI think if could modify driver/build.mk to add \n\n    driver-$(CONFIG_CHARGER_BQ25720)+\u003dcharger/bq25710.o\n\nthen the dependency in config.h between CONFIG_CHARGER_BQ25720 and CONFIG_CHARGER_BQ25710 can be removed.",
